name yardstick_150_random_loss_5pct_40seeds
describe yardstick for #150: random_loss_5pct with every v2 switch on, 40 seeds on both stacks (parity data only, no expectations)
# Not a regression test. `compare_seeds 40` gives libwebrtc's per-seed queue spread (cc.queue_p95_ms 44 vs 29.5 over 10 seeds).
compare_seeds 40
cc v2
pacer v2
tcc v2
rtx v2
rtcp v2
keyframe v2
allocator v2
packetization v2
audio v2
duration 30s
at 0s capacity=2000kbps delay=40ms jitter=3ms loss=5% queue=300ms
